cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or workflow, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PDAC_Pipeline: Analysis code and reproducibility package for an integrative multi-omic PDAC study"
abstract: >
  Analysis scripts, validator scripts, workflow documentation, decision log,
  AI-agent/K-Dense skill usage log, and dataset accession metadata for an
  integrative multi-omic analysis of pancreatic ductal adenocarcinoma (PDAC),
  coordinated through a human-supervised, LLM-assisted multi-agent
  bioinformatics workflow.
